# Levels

World layer: `LevelGenerator`, `StaticPlatform`, `LevelPiece`, `LevelGrove`.
World scene: `Assets/Scenes/World.unity`. There are no level prefabs.

## Scenes — do not mix

| Scene | Whose | What is inside |
|---|---|---|
| `SampleScene` | physics / stand | camera + `GameManager` (`GameProcess`, `GroundBuilder`). Simple. **Do not touch.** |
| `Bird` | flight + bird AI | flat ground, `humanCount = 0`, `birdCount = 1`, `birdDrive` wander. No generator. |
| `BirdFlock50` | flock AI | flat ground, `birdCount = 50`, `birdDrive` wander. No generator. |
| `Chicken` | hens | flat ground, `birdCount = 5`, `birdKind` chicken. No generator. |
| `Tree` | plants | flat ground, `treeCount = 1`. Do not attach the generator. |
| `Dog` | quadruped | flat ground, `dogCount ≥ 1`. Do not attach the generator. |
| `World` | levels | `WorldManager` + `LevelGenerator` Test1. `birdCount = 0`, `birdDrive` off. |

`HeadlessTrial` and `HeadlessBuild` stay on `SampleScene` and draw flat
ground themselves. `World` and `Bird` are not in the stand build.

Do not attach the generator on `SampleScene`, `Bird`, `BirdFlock50`,
`Chicken`, `Tree`, or `Dog`, and do not call `AddComponent<LevelGenerator>`.
`GameProcess` starts the yard only when there is a human and no birds,
trees-from-`treeCount`, or dogs. A stray generator on a bird scene is
ignored — wander leash stays on flat ground.

## Profiles

| Profile | Where | Ground |
|---|---|---|
| `Flat` | stand, no `LevelGenerator` | `GroundBuilder`, one rectangle |
| `Test1` | `World` by default | authored "Yard": 5 cm curbs with a dip, square, gate and lookout; finish sign at x=48; tape to x=96 |
| `Course` | `course` flag | random steps with no gaps |
| `Steps` | `steps` flag | even stair by `stepHeight` |

Textures: `Assets/Resources/Level/` and fallback path `Art/dirt`, `Art/grass`.
visul assignment — `Tools/visul-test1-textures.md`.
Do not touch `SampleScene`.

Parallax: `LevelBackdrop` builds 8 layers under `ParallaxRoot` (not under
`Level`). `follow` near 1 = horizon almost glued to the camera; near 0 =
moves like the ground. Yard `PlantTree` stay in world space. No colliders
on backdrop. Update in `LateUpdate` after `CameraFollow`.

Yard grove: `LevelGrove` plants `PlantTree` with `TreeRig.Static` on
Test1. Do not set `GameProcess.treeCount` on World (that path is `Sway`,
scene `Tree` only). Do not change `PlantTree` sizes or springs.

When `humanCount > 1`, it stays `Flat`.

Spawn surface is **y = −2.0**, the human is at **y = −0.82**. Chunks ≤ 0
are always flat at this height.

## Spawn platforms

Static `BoxCollider2D`, no `Rigidbody2D`. Size is `sprite.size` and
`collider.size`, not `localScale`.
No gaps between pieces: a gap for a ragdoll is a fall, not an obstacle.
Chunk generation is in `Update`, not in `FixedUpdate`.
